meta {
  name: events
  seq: 1
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  v1 (this folder). Payloads and responses are unchanged, but the schedule/
  location fields below are deprecated (Swagger `deprecated: true` + JSDoc
  `@deprecated`) and will be dropped in phase 2 once schedule/location fully
  moves to the bookings domain — see `odd/tasks/event-fields-deprecation.md`:

    serviceStartsAt, serviceEndsAt, venueName, serviceLocationUrl,
    serviceTypeId, printTemplate, printTemplates, decorativeIcon

  New integrations should read the `v2` subfolder instead, whose responses
  resolve schedule/location only from the contract's EVENT booking (see its
  own docs). v1 create/update still accept the deprecated fields above (do
  not remove them from existing client code yet), they are just no longer
  the source of truth for status or for v2/session/gallery display.
}
